    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stranded on a strange island where ancient hostile forces lurk in the shadows, you must survive, explore... and find your way home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scavenge for water, food, shelter. Battle disease, exhaustion, and despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forage, mine, fish, cook\u2014but also fight. Craft equipment to gain unique Power Dice (wood/silver/gold), swaying your fate in critical moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key actions\u2014especially combat\u2014are resolved through dice rolls. Forge gear tailored to each challenge, and outmaneuver dangers in a living world ruled by day/night cycles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What secrets does this island hold? What are you truly fleeing? And how far will you go to survive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Struggle to survive in a hostile environment and find a way back to civilization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the island and gather resources to meet vital needs while avoiding disease, exhaustion, or despair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your camp to improve rest, healing, and survival conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft equipment to obtain Power Dice (Wood/Silver/Gold) suited for every challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover secrets of an island both beautiful and eerie, shaped by day-night cycles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reveal the truth behind your arrival, the hero\u2019s intentions, and the shadows of their past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face enemies in turn-based combat where strategy and dice decide your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Dice or Die</i> offers unique tabletop-inspired gameplay.<br>Most critical actions are resolved by dice rolls, adding uncertainty to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire these Power Dice through equipment\u2014crafted in wood, silver, or gold tiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stranded on a strange island where ancient hostile forces lurk in the shadows, you must survive, explore... and find your way home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scavenge for water, food, shelter. Battle disease, exhaustion, and despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forage, mine, fish, cook\u2014but also fight. Craft equipment to gain unique Power Dice (wood/silver/gold), swaying your fate in critical moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key actions\u2014especially combat\u2014are resolved through dice rolls. Forge gear tailored to each challenge, and outmaneuver dangers in a living world ruled by day/night cycles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What secrets does this island hold? What are you truly fleeing? And how far will you go to survive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Struggle to survive in a hostile environment and find a way back to civilization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the island and gather resources to meet vital needs while avoiding disease, exhaustion, or despair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your camp to improve rest, healing, and survival conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft equipment to obtain Power Dice (Wood/Silver/Gold) suited for every challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover secrets of an island both beautiful and eerie, shaped by day-night cycles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reveal the truth behind your arrival, the hero\u2019s intentions, and the shadows of their past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face enemies in turn-based combat where strategy and dice decide your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Dice or Die</i> offers unique tabletop-inspired gameplay.<br>Most critical actions are resolved by dice rolls, adding uncertainty to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire these Power Dice through equipment\u2014crafted in wood, silver, or gold tiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
